OL,3,GNEWSAPublic sector pay agreed but 'not
OL,4,Agone far enough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic sector employees in Guernsey
OL,7,Fhave agreed a pay increase, but a trade
OL,8,Funion has said it does not go far
OL,9,Fenough.
OL,11,FUnite the Union, representing public
OL,12,Fsector employees in jobs across the
OL,13,Fisland including hospital porters,
OL,14,Fsewage cart drivers and airport staff,
OL,15,Fsaid it balloted members on offers
OL,16,Fwhich varied across pay bands and they
OL,17,Fwere accepted by 66% of those who
OL,18,Fvoted.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
