OL,3,GNEWSAPublic sector pay agreed but 'not
OL,4,Agone far enough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe employer's offer was a 5% increase
OL,7,Ffor Grade A staff, 4.4% for Grade B and
OL,8,F4% for Grade C, while Grade Ds were
OL,9,Foffered 3.7%.
OL,11,FThe States of Guernsey has been
OL,12,Fcontacted for comment.
